How are you building this? If you ask for MKREPRO (e.g. via -v
MKREPRO=yes) you need to provide a MKREPRO_TIMESTAMP (via -v) as well.
Or leave it to build.sh to figure it out by using build.sh -P and dropping
the -v MKREPRO=yes.

